      "label": "Terrorism Association",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the real-world association between Islam and terrorism, which is a common and dangerous stereotype. This association is used to dehumanize Muslims and justify prejudice, despite the fact that the vast majority of Muslims condemn terrorism.",
